  "description": "Motobecane USA has carefully crafted and engineered three categories of Carbon Fiber Road bikes.\n\nProRoad Built for Speed | Long and Low riding position is great for aggressive riders\n\n3Road Built for Comfort | Triple ring drivetrains afford lower gearing | Semi-compact geometry allows a more relaxed riding position\n\nProRoad Built for Speed+Comfort | Equipped with an eye for performance | Semi-compact geometry allows a more relaxed riding position\n\nThe Le Champion CF LTD is equipped with a compact crankset for more climbing gears. The Le Champion CF series are the top of the carbon foodchain with a Monocoque High-Modulus Carbon Fiber frame and available High-Modulus Carbon Fiber fork. Le Champion CF LTD Carbon frames are engineered from +HIGH MODULUS 12k Weave Carbon Fiber Monocoque with advanced extreme high-pressure, bladder-molded Monocoque construction. ResponseShape downtube design. QuadSection chainstays for optimum power transfer. OrganicForm seatstays for rider ergonomics, comfort and compliance. FlowThrough top tube, continuous line extending to the monostay for a more beautiful shape and ride quality.",
